# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Frontend environment (PRODUCTION)
# Vite exposes only vars prefixed with VITE_ to the browser.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────

# VITE_API_URL ko KHAALI rakho.
# Isse api.js '/api' (relative) use karega, jise `vite preview` ka proxy
# same-origin par backend (https://st-cashbook-backend.onrender.com) tak
# bhej deta hai. Same-origin hone se auth cookie properly chalti hai
# (cross-site hone par browser cookie nahi bhejta -> 401 "token missing").
#
# Agar backend ko SEEDHA (cross-origin) call karna ho to yaha full URL daalo,
# par tab cookie ki jagah Bearer-token auth chahiye hoga.
VITE_API_URL=
